OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for throwing bottle at
OL,4,Amigrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-two has become the first
OL,7,Fman jailed following an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotest in Portsmouth after admitting
OL,9,Fthrowing a plastic bottle and swearing
OL,10,Fat police.
OL,12,FDel Somerville, 42, previously pleaded
OL,13,Fguilty to violent disorder at the
OL,14,Fcity's crown court following the
OL,15,Fovernight protest near Eastney Marina
OL,16,Fon 6 September.
OL,18,FHundreds of protesters gathered after a
OL,19,Fboat carrying about 120 migrants was
OL,20,Fbrought ashore near Eastney Beach.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
